Z||000000||gt boy||08-12-2001||09:46 PM||||i have a question concerning the short shifters that are out there on the market...are they just cut down a little shorter???  or has the bottom linkage mounts been reajusted?? <P>i am looking to shorten my throw but i want to do it right. <P>if anyone has done either or both i would like to hear from you.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Fieroist||08-12-2001||10:08 PM||||On my previous car I shortened the shifter by removing the shift lever, then grinding off the welds at the bottom of the round section, then cut approx. 1" off, and then rewelded it back together. I liked the effect of having a shorter shifter although it did increase the amount of effort needed to change gears a little bit.<p>[This message has been edited by Fieroist (edited 08-12-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Primaris||08-12-2001||10:25 PM||||Most are just shortened shafts but there is one for sale on this page with a longer bottom shaft. Check out the competition shifter.  It claims to have a longer lower end. <A HREF="http://www.rodneydickman.com/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.rodneydickman.com/index.html</A> <P>------------------<BR>Signatures are a waste of bandwidth!||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cooter||08-12-2001||10:48 PM||||I started with an 84 shifter handle, shortened the shaft and extended the lower cable attachment point by about 10mm. It requires a good bit of effort to shift even with new cables.||||reg||1
Z||000004||artherd||08-12-2001||11:56 PM||||Rodney makes an awesome product, well worth it.<P>He shortens both the lever, and legenthens the below-console throw, or one or the other. (he has several shifters to choose from.)<P>I have a Euro replacement arm in my car, and I love it.  Actually, I have one in each of my fieros.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/88ttop.jpg">  <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top Metalic Red<BR>88 Formula, Silver<BR>87 Coupe, Metalic Red<BR>"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>                -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||1
